      <h1 style="margin-top:10px">How to run a local badminton league: write the awkward rules first</h1>
      <p class="lede">“Everyone plays everyone and we add up the results” describes the easy 20%. A league earns trust in the other 80%: the postponed match, the ineligible reserve, the team that withdraws in February and the table tie nobody expected.</p>
      <div class="guide-meta">
        <span class="gm-tag">Guide</span>
        <span>Leagues</span>
        <span>14 min read</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
