        <p style="color:var(--muted-2);font-size:.95rem;margin:0">Current local-league examples checked on 26 August 2026: <a href="https://www.coventrybadminton.co.uk/rules" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Coventry Badminton Association rules</a>, <a href="https://www.exeterbadmintonleague.co.uk/rules/players" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Exeter &amp; District player rules</a>, and <a href="https://www.solihullbadmintonleague.co.uk/league-rules" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Solihull District Badminton League rules</a>. They are evidence of how real leagues solve edge cases, not templates to copy wholesale.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
